@B = https://localhost:7182

### Random: succeeds about 30% of the time
GET {{B}}/api/demo/unstable

### Force each outcome
GET {{B}}/api/demo/unstable?mode=ok

###
GET {{B}}/api/demo/unstable?mode=notfound

###
GET {{B}}/api/demo/unstable?mode=unavailable

### Unhandled exception → ProblemDetails with a traceId
GET {{B}}/api/demo/unstable?mode=throw

### Slow response (timeouts)
GET {{B}}/api/demo/slow?ms=3000

### Non-idempotent call
POST {{B}}/api/demo/orders?mode=ok
